    "body": "Is exposing this to workers intentional? I notice https://github.com/garykac/clipboard/blob/master/clipboard.md says \"Note: Having this on the navigator means that it would be accessible from workers\", but https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/#clipboard-interface only adds to `Navigator` and not to `WorkerNavigator`, so I'm unsure whether the intent is for this async clipboard API to be usable in workers or not.",
    "created_at": "2017-02-18T00:36:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-23T06:49:11Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2372#discussion_r101875065",
