    "body": "Yeah, I agree, but @garykac indicated positive support from Apple, Mozilla, Microsoft, and of course him from Google in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2190#issuecomment-280196889. I'm not sure that extends specifically to the existence in workers, but I think it's best to trust @garykac as the owner of async clipboard to do the right thing here. We can of course check in and revise later if we find out things didn't go according to plan.",
