    "body": "It is a bit speculative and the positive support did not explicitly call out workers (although worker support was mentioned in the initial description).\r\n\r\nPros:\r\n* Maybe someone has some awesome webapp idea that needs workers\r\n\r\nCons:\r\n* Maybe someone can horribly abuse the API if it's available on workers.\r\n\r\nTo date, I have not heard of any scenario where people who wanted this feature needed it in a worker.\r\n\r\nGiven that it's easy enough to update the spec later to add support for ServiceWorkers, I'm OK with omitting it for now and adding it later if needed.",
    "created_at": "2017-03-18T00:15:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-23T06:49:11Z",
